Hi All,

I have just tried a clean install of R 2.12.0 on a fresh MS/Windows 7.
I installed:

http://downloads.sourceforge.net/gtk-win/gtk2-runtime-2.16.6-2010-02-24-ash.exe
http://cran.r-project.org/bin/windows/base/R-2.12.0-win.exe

Then starting up R 2.12.0 (not R x64 2.12.0), then

> install.packages("rattle")
> library(rattle)
> rattle()

worked just fine.

Ajay, could you check whether this is what you did?

Thanks,
Graham

