I think I see the problem....

Do not install

  http://downloads.sourceforge.net/gtk-win/gtk2-runtime-2.16.6-2010-02-24-ash.exe

Uninstall it (if installed), then in R do:

> library(RGtk2)

and let it install the right package.

Regards,
Graham

