>>> install.packages("rattle")
>>> library(XML)
>>> .path.package(package="XML")
>>> library(rattle)
>> That should give the attached error popup.
>> Exit R and browse to the location of the installed XML package (the output
>> of the .path.package() function call above). Then browse into libs/i386/.
>> Delete the zlib1.dll file.
>> Start R again:
>>> rattle()
